{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id202647484"}, "name":{"label":"danknapp21"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-06T09:49:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13720080016"}, "title":{"label":"Paid for lifetime Subcription…still asking me to buy it"}, "content":{"label":"I paid for a lifetime subscription. I have the receipt, I have the bank statements. Everytime I try and use the app, it asks me to buy a subscription. I’ve tried clicking restore purchases. It claims I never made a purchase, which is false because I have the bank statements and receipt to prove that I do purchase it. I emailed customer support, and have yet to hear back from them. I maybe should have taken it as a red flag when you go to their website, and it gives you a contact us button, and a button right below it, that is for requesting a refund…maybe I’ll change my review, but still haven’t heard back from them, so I probably won’t", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
