{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id259900752"}, "name":{"label":"J23…NY"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-26T05:59:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"171"}, "id":{"label":"13677829343"}, "title":{"label":"App won’t work"}, "content":{"label":"I purchased the lifetime subscription for $49.99 but was charged twice, nearly $100 total. The app still does not work and keeps asking me to subscribe again as if no purchase exists. I deleted and reinstalled the app multiple times with no fix.\n\nAfter experiencing this, I checked the reviews and was shocked to see many others reporting the exact same issue. This feels less like a glitch and more like a pattern.\n\nWhat’s especially disappointing is that this app promotes Christianity and a closer relationship with God, yet customers are being double charged for a product that doesn’t function. That is extremely discouraging and does not align with the values being advertised.\n\nI would not recommend this app until these issues are addressed and refunds are properly handled.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
